WEBVTT

01:18.140 --> 01:21.510
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.670 --> 01:24.570
[Episode 5]

01:26.760 --> 01:28.990
Boss, today is a day off.

01:27.510 --> 01:30.140
[Zhizhong Construction Investment Securities Co., Ltd]

01:29.010 --> 01:30.370
Why are we at the office?

01:30.550 --> 01:33.009
Close the door.
I want to show you something.

01:37.650 --> 01:38.259
What is it?

01:38.900 --> 01:40.470
This is what I've sorted out

01:40.490 --> 01:41.420
from Shanlifang's materials.

01:41.420 --> 01:42.080
Take a look.

01:50.190 --> 01:52.530
The valuation of intangible assets
is illegal.

01:52.530 --> 01:54.150
The amortization treatment
is non-compliant.

01:54.150 --> 01:56.780
They did a lot of work
to inflate goodwill.

01:57.979 --> 01:59.570
In the financial statements,

01:59.570 --> 02:01.370
there are also obvious
related-party transactions.

02:01.370 --> 02:05.030
There are traces of intentionally
inflating revenue and profit.

02:05.860 --> 02:06.790
Such a major...

02:06.750 --> 02:13.070
[Zhizhong Construction Investment Securities Co., Ltd]

02:07.580 --> 02:09.289
Such a major fraud scheme,

02:09.310 --> 02:10.889
and it's been so well concealed?

02:10.889 --> 02:13.330
Chairman Liao
really put a lot of effort into it.

02:13.330 --> 02:15.700
After all, he has an expert helping him.

02:17.630 --> 02:19.960
I'm telling you, this must be re-audited.

02:20.400 --> 02:21.320
Boss.

02:21.770 --> 02:23.480
Well, if you hadn't checked,

02:23.510 --> 02:24.720
no one would have found out.

02:24.720 --> 02:26.440
He Jing hasn't made any moves.

02:26.510 --> 02:29.030
Fang Yun and the others
probably don't know yet.

02:29.030 --> 02:30.540
You underestimate her.

02:31.370 --> 02:33.220
She has reviewed more projects
than I have.

02:33.220 --> 02:34.560
If I can find these problems,

02:34.560 --> 02:35.820
do you think she can't?

02:35.820 --> 02:37.630
Then why doesn't she announce it?

02:37.630 --> 02:40.060
[Zhizhong Construction Investment Securities Co., Ltd]

02:37.760 --> 02:40.180
At least she should discuss
how to solve it with us.

02:40.180 --> 02:42.740
Whoever brings this to the table first

02:42.890 --> 02:44.829
will offend Liao Jinshan.

02:45.230 --> 02:46.250
She's not stupid.

02:47.520 --> 02:48.910
So what's her plan?

02:48.940 --> 02:52.280
Letting Shanlifang pass smoothly?

02:57.510 --> 02:59.180
If we all hide it,

03:01.200 --> 03:02.580
and the CSRC investigates later,

03:02.580 --> 03:03.850
once the problem is found,

03:03.850 --> 03:08.160
[Zhizhong Construction Investment Securities Co., Ltd]

03:03.940 --> 03:05.870
neither of us will get away with it.

03:06.060 --> 03:08.920
Helping others break the law
is ruining ourselves.

03:09.330 --> 03:11.800
The only way is for all of us to stand up

03:12.060 --> 03:14.390
and put pressure on Shanlifang together.

03:14.760 --> 03:18.079
But Fang Yun is obviously playing dumb.

03:18.170 --> 03:19.300
Because she's waiting for us

03:19.300 --> 03:20.630
to expose the problems.

03:21.079 --> 03:22.840
We do the dirty work,

03:22.970 --> 03:24.280
and she reaps the benefits.

03:24.280 --> 03:25.030
Understand?

03:26.520 --> 03:27.650
That's despicable.

03:30.010 --> 03:32.220
But we can't be like her and conceal it.

03:32.280 --> 03:33.210
If so,

03:33.460 --> 03:35.260
wouldn't she get what she wants?

03:35.820 --> 03:36.770
Let's do this.

03:37.130 --> 03:38.790
She's afraid of Liao Jinshan.

03:39.060 --> 03:39.940
But I'm not.

03:41.310 --> 03:48.290
[Zhizhong Construction Investment Securities Co., Ltd]

03:43.160 --> 03:44.290
Let's investigate.

04:12.920 --> 04:13.440
Right.

04:14.330 --> 04:15.860
Uncle, wait for me a moment.

04:15.870 --> 04:17.250
I forgot a document.

04:17.480 --> 04:19.250
Why get it now? Do it tomorrow.

04:19.709 --> 04:20.860
I can't.

04:21.019 --> 04:22.550
Director Fang is angry.

04:22.580 --> 04:24.300
She told me to give it to her
tomorrow morning.

04:24.300 --> 04:25.340
Otherwise, I won't survive

04:25.340 --> 04:26.660
in this project team.

04:26.890 --> 04:28.420
If she dares to trouble you,

04:28.770 --> 04:30.700
tell me, and I'll back you up.

04:31.170 --> 04:32.510
How?

04:32.530 --> 04:34.350
She's a pillar of He Jing.

04:34.720 --> 04:36.050
Not like Qian Fei,

04:36.070 --> 04:37.400
who can be fired easily.

04:38.450 --> 04:39.810
Wait for me in the car.

04:39.840 --> 04:40.930
I'll be quick.

04:41.520 --> 04:42.960
Okay, hurry up.

04:42.990 --> 04:43.630
Okay.

04:48.340 --> 04:50.120
[Shanghai World Financial Center]

04:53.760 --> 04:55.220
Didn't you resign?

04:55.250 --> 04:56.510
Why are you still here?

04:57.030 --> 04:58.000
I want to confirm

04:58.020 --> 04:59.630
why I was laid off.

05:01.880 --> 05:03.280
That's right. You saw it.

05:03.280 --> 05:04.630
Mr. Kong is my uncle.

05:04.660 --> 05:07.120
You think you were fired
because of my uncle?

05:07.140 --> 05:07.820
Wasn't I?

05:09.990 --> 05:12.520
Your professional skills
are indeed strong.

05:12.570 --> 05:14.100
But you've been in the company
for so long,

05:14.100 --> 05:16.160
and you don't even know what you want.

05:16.390 --> 05:18.150
If we competed fairly,

05:18.280 --> 05:20.230
I would definitely stay
and you would be fired.

05:20.230 --> 05:21.190
That's normal.

05:22.340 --> 05:23.720
Whether Mr. Kong is my uncle

05:23.720 --> 05:24.980
wouldn't matter much.

05:25.120 --> 05:27.120
But you don't even understand this.

05:29.050 --> 05:30.580
I know what you're here for.

05:31.820 --> 05:33.110
To find Director Fang

05:34.520 --> 05:35.950
and ask her for a job.

05:36.350 --> 05:39.280
What? You don't want to
stay in your comfort zone now?

05:40.450 --> 05:41.800
But look at yourself.

05:42.200 --> 05:44.100
Why should she give you a job?

05:44.460 --> 05:45.659
Stop dreaming.

06:06.890 --> 06:09.200
Why would Director Fang give me a chance?

06:09.930 --> 06:12.050
Yeah, why?

06:22.700 --> 06:24.220
Xinyao was right.

06:25.320 --> 06:26.810
She works harder than me

06:27.730 --> 06:29.190
and is more clear-headed.

06:55.610 --> 06:56.260
Stop screaming! It's me!

06:56.260 --> 06:57.659
It's me! It's me! It's me!

06:57.909 --> 06:59.710
It's me. Can you stop screaming?

07:00.910 --> 07:02.490
Why were you screaming?
You scared me to death.

07:02.490 --> 07:04.560
Who's the scary one here?
With that on your face,

07:04.560 --> 07:05.760
you look like a ghost!

07:05.950 --> 07:07.240
This is Gui Lili's mask.

07:07.240 --> 07:08.300
It's a pity to throw it away,

07:08.300 --> 07:09.140
so I used it.

07:09.170 --> 07:10.790
It felt quite comfortable to use.

07:10.790 --> 07:12.390
What's going on in the house?

07:13.070 --> 07:14.470
How should I know? I should ask you.

07:14.470 --> 07:15.320
The power suddenly went out.

07:15.320 --> 07:16.390
It's pitch black.

07:19.530 --> 07:20.930
It's fine outside.

07:21.960 --> 07:23.290
What's going on inside?

07:23.610 --> 07:26.050
Did... you use any high-power appliances?

07:26.080 --> 07:26.760
I...

07:29.690 --> 07:30.590
I see.

07:31.270 --> 07:33.230
Could it be my new oven?

07:33.650 --> 07:34.710
You bought an oven?

07:40.150 --> 07:41.000
It's huge.

07:43.500 --> 07:44.000
Where is it?

07:44.000 --> 07:44.860
Here. Here.

07:46.090 --> 07:47.480
Look how big it is.

07:48.230 --> 07:49.500
Such a big oven?

07:49.820 --> 07:51.480
Who allowed you to buy an oven?

07:51.780 --> 07:52.720
What do you need it for?

07:52.720 --> 07:53.650
Heating pizza.

07:53.670 --> 07:55.440
Can't you heat pizza in the microwave?

07:55.440 --> 07:56.780
Is the taste the same?

07:57.040 --> 07:57.990
I don't allow it.

07:59.780 --> 08:00.650
You don't?

08:01.090 --> 08:01.900
I thought

08:01.930 --> 08:03.250
since I bought it, you could use it too,

08:03.250 --> 08:04.390
and you'd be happy.

08:05.030 --> 08:06.820
It's not about money.

08:06.840 --> 08:08.760
It's your lack of common sense

08:08.790 --> 08:10.860
that caused a circuit safety issue.

08:11.960 --> 08:15.040
Then the dishwasher is out too?

08:15.490 --> 08:17.090
You bought a dishwasher too?

08:19.510 --> 08:21.500
This way, neither of us
has to wash dishes.

08:21.500 --> 08:22.830
Wouldn't that be great?

08:22.900 --> 08:24.200
Come on, look at this kitchen.

08:24.200 --> 08:26.440
Is there room for a dishwasher?

08:29.460 --> 08:31.220
It seems like there isn't.

08:32.049 --> 08:33.049
What should we do?

08:34.640 --> 08:36.130
Why don't we just remodel

08:36.159 --> 08:36.970
the kitchen?

08:37.200 --> 08:38.600
Just a few bowls—

08:38.679 --> 08:40.100
it takes less than a minute to wash them.

08:40.100 --> 08:41.700
What's the point of putting them

08:41.700 --> 08:42.549
in the dishwasher

08:42.549 --> 08:44.220
and letting it run for 2 hours

08:44.340 --> 08:45.050
and buzz non-stop?

08:45.050 --> 08:45.990
Noise is not a problem.

08:45.990 --> 08:47.140
Just swap the bedroom door

08:47.140 --> 08:48.110
for a soundproof one.

08:48.110 --> 08:51.040
Why don't you just tear down the house
and rebuild it?

08:53.000 --> 08:53.870
Where are you going?

08:53.870 --> 08:55.220
To fix it.

08:55.380 --> 08:56.330
You think everyone is like you,

08:56.330 --> 08:57.990
content to fumble in the dark?

09:06.930 --> 09:07.660
That's it?

09:08.410 --> 09:09.160
The breaker tripped.

09:09.160 --> 09:10.180
Next time this happens,

09:10.180 --> 09:11.660
just push the switch up.

09:16.720 --> 09:18.180
Who is it at this late hour?

09:18.180 --> 09:18.870
Who is it?

09:19.490 --> 09:20.320
Electrician.

09:20.930 --> 09:21.730
Electrician?

09:23.330 --> 09:23.930
Hello.

09:24.320 --> 09:26.370
Hello, your power went out, right?

09:26.400 --> 09:28.930
Yes, but it's fixed now.
The breaker tripped.

09:29.110 --> 09:30.410
Even if I don't fix anything,

09:30.410 --> 09:32.070
I still have to charge a call-out fee.

09:32.070 --> 09:32.860
Call-out...

09:34.410 --> 09:35.270
You called him?

09:35.910 --> 09:38.570
I didn't know
you just needed to push the switch.

09:38.850 --> 09:40.260
How much is it?

09:40.290 --> 09:41.200
Two hundred.

09:48.000 --> 09:49.720
It's late-night expedited service,

09:49.720 --> 09:51.660
so there's an extra charge.

09:51.890 --> 09:53.100
Yes, of course.

09:53.770 --> 09:54.900
Of course.

09:55.080 --> 09:56.270
Do I scan you or do you scan me?

09:56.270 --> 09:57.190
You scan me.

09:57.860 --> 09:58.480
Okay.

10:00.280 --> 10:01.150
Two hundred.

10:02.000 --> 10:03.060
Okay, thanks for your trouble.

10:03.060 --> 10:03.710
Thank you.

10:03.730 --> 10:04.510
Goodbye.

10:07.070 --> 10:07.900
You're quite something.

10:07.900 --> 10:09.890
Couldn't you just give me the 200?

10:10.300 --> 10:11.830
I didn't know you knew this.

10:12.070 --> 10:12.660
And I didn't know

10:12.660 --> 10:13.520
when you'd be back.

10:13.520 --> 10:15.050
Couldn't you check online?

10:15.610 --> 10:18.090
There'd be
tens of thousands of results online.

10:18.090 --> 10:19.180
The time I spent researching this

10:19.180 --> 10:20.840
could've earned me a fortune.

10:21.610 --> 10:23.440
Try not to do things yourself

10:23.470 --> 10:25.400
when they can be solved with money.

10:27.230 --> 10:28.340
Landlady, let me tell you,

10:28.340 --> 10:31.070
your time is more valuable than money.

10:32.120 --> 10:33.090
Stop wasting it.

10:42.580 --> 10:43.520
What's wrong?

10:44.190 --> 10:45.650
Did I say something wrong?

10:47.030 --> 10:47.820
No.

10:48.330 --> 10:51.210
It's just that no one has ever told me

10:52.740 --> 10:54.740
my time is more valuable than money.

10:54.740 --> 10:55.940
So thinking about

10:56.150 --> 10:57.940
how I spent such precious time

10:57.960 --> 10:59.560
on someone who wasn't worth it,

10:59.560 --> 11:00.940
it makes me angry.

11:02.640 --> 11:04.300
As long as you're not mad at me.

11:05.670 --> 11:06.670
See?

11:08.700 --> 11:10.630
It's good having me around, right?

11:10.760 --> 11:12.790
You'll know after we live together longer.

11:12.790 --> 11:15.390
There's a lot you can learn from me.

11:18.120 --> 11:18.730
Well?

11:19.490 --> 11:21.180
If you take me as your master now,

11:21.180 --> 11:22.640
I'm willing to accept you.

11:22.960 --> 11:23.620
Seriously.

11:23.620 --> 11:25.280
How can you be so shameless?

11:25.340 --> 11:26.490
You did such a stupid thing

11:26.490 --> 11:28.200
and gave away 200 for nothing.

11:29.060 --> 11:31.470
What am I supposed to learn from you?
How to waste money?

11:31.470 --> 11:33.310
Waste money?

11:33.930 --> 11:36.000
It's a life attitude.

11:37.120 --> 11:38.130
You don't understand.

11:38.130 --> 11:38.990
Forget it then.

11:39.330 --> 11:41.730
You're the one who should learn.
Follow me!

11:42.530 --> 11:43.530
Hurry up!

11:44.480 --> 11:45.810
Main gas valve.

11:46.960 --> 11:47.800
Up here.

11:47.890 --> 11:49.110
This is the main gas valve.

11:49.110 --> 11:50.620
If you're not home for a long time,

11:50.620 --> 11:51.960
make sure to turn it off.
It would be dangerous if you don't.

11:51.960 --> 11:53.300
Also, when you cook...

11:53.320 --> 11:54.430
You know how to turn it on, right?

11:54.430 --> 11:55.530
I don't cook.

11:55.550 --> 11:57.030
You still need it to boil water.

11:57.030 --> 11:58.290
I drink bottled water.

12:01.280 --> 12:01.870
Anyway,

12:01.900 --> 12:03.880
if you ever need to use the valve,

12:03.900 --> 12:05.820
remember to tighten it.

12:06.640 --> 12:08.520
So there are so many valves?

12:10.830 --> 12:12.990
How did you live before?

12:14.880 --> 12:15.550
Where I lived before,

12:15.550 --> 12:17.380
we had a 24-hour butler.

12:17.520 --> 12:19.380
One call could solve everything.

12:20.450 --> 12:22.190
Gosh, isn't that a waste of money?

12:22.190 --> 12:24.240
Couldn't you learn to do it yourself?

12:24.240 --> 12:26.170
Now I know why you can't save money.

12:26.310 --> 12:27.160
Why?

12:28.620 --> 12:29.900
Like you said,

12:29.930 --> 12:31.680
you bought your time with money.

12:31.680 --> 12:34.410
That's why now you're poor
and have nothing to do.

12:37.160 --> 12:39.200
Your arguing skills have improved.

12:42.380 --> 12:44.000
Let me tell you, Landlady.

12:44.110 --> 12:45.080
Don't get ahead of yourself

12:45.080 --> 12:46.860
just because you own a house.

12:48.320 --> 12:50.410
The asset value of your apartment,

12:50.430 --> 12:52.540
minus depreciation, taxes, fees,
and maintenance,

12:52.540 --> 12:55.080
plus your bank loans and money
borrowed from friends and family,

12:55.080 --> 12:57.610
along with the next 30 years
of loan interest—

12:57.800 --> 12:58.680
do the math.

12:59.180 --> 12:59.850
What else?

13:00.210 --> 13:01.800
Your cash investments
and compound returns,

13:01.800 --> 13:03.950
plus all the favors and effort
you've put into it,

13:03.950 --> 13:06.770
and the risk of not being able to repay it
if you lose your job.

13:06.770 --> 13:08.490
Your situation
isn't much better than mine.

13:08.490 --> 13:09.420
I'm telling you.

13:09.500 --> 13:10.960
So stop being so arrogant.

13:11.440 --> 13:13.870
You were an investment banker.

13:14.130 --> 13:16.050
How can you not do the math?

13:17.330 --> 13:17.880
I think it's necessary

13:17.880 --> 13:19.730
to introduce you to a plastic surgeon.

13:19.730 --> 13:20.730
What do you mean?

13:21.330 --> 13:23.380
A little work here and here.

13:24.060 --> 13:26.880
If I get plastic surgery,
I don't have to pay off the loan?

13:26.880 --> 13:28.410
Open your eyes wider

13:28.430 --> 13:30.110
and broaden your horizons.

13:30.160 --> 13:31.340
Don't limit yourself

13:31.340 --> 13:33.280
to just houses, breakers, and valves.

13:33.280 --> 13:33.850
Li Yifei,

13:33.870 --> 13:35.510
stop talking down to me!

13:35.540 --> 13:37.220
Get yourself together first.

13:37.510 --> 13:39.030
You don't even have any common sense.

13:39.030 --> 13:40.490
How did your mom raise you?

13:47.200 --> 13:47.960
My mom...

13:49.980 --> 13:51.510
passed away a long time ago.

13:57.930 --> 13:58.450
Well...

14:00.500 --> 14:01.280
I'm sorry.

14:03.840 --> 14:04.440
It's fine.

14:12.210 --> 14:13.160
I'm like you.

14:15.270 --> 14:16.870
My mom passed away early too.

14:17.760 --> 14:18.570
So...

14:20.230 --> 14:21.260
I understand

14:22.400 --> 14:23.230
how you feel.

14:38.430 --> 14:40.090
Why are we talking about this?

14:41.250 --> 14:41.970
Oh, right.

14:42.970 --> 14:44.770
There's a package for you today.

14:45.690 --> 14:46.960
I put it in your room.

14:48.030 --> 14:49.030
Thanks.

15:11.090 --> 15:12.310
[Time]

15:38.630 --> 15:41.520
[Time]

15:44.560 --> 15:48.930
Fei, I was looking at
old photos the other day.

15:49.110 --> 15:50.640
I picked some to send to you.

15:51.160 --> 15:53.040
You'll have your own home soon.

15:53.850 --> 15:55.830
We can't be by your side,

15:56.180 --> 15:58.330
so let these photos keep you company.

16:00.730 --> 16:02.130
Every time we call you,

16:02.150 --> 16:04.640
you always say how well you're doing.

16:05.180 --> 16:07.580
Auntie He and I are happy for you.

16:08.420 --> 16:09.330
But I know

16:09.850 --> 16:11.560
you only share the good news.

16:14.340 --> 16:17.320
Life isn't always smooth sailing.

16:17.720 --> 16:19.290
There are always bad times.

16:20.410 --> 16:22.190
Don't worry about making me worry.

16:22.190 --> 16:23.460
Good or bad,

16:23.690 --> 16:24.770
you can tell Dad.

16:27.090 --> 16:28.440
Even if you get married

16:28.570 --> 16:30.000
and become a wife

16:30.130 --> 16:31.350
or a mother,

16:32.330 --> 16:34.860
you will always
be my dearest daughter first.

16:35.890 --> 16:37.530
Come home if you miss it.

16:37.930 --> 16:39.690
Call me if you want to talk.

16:40.420 --> 16:42.320
Dad will always be here for you.

17:04.910 --> 17:07.390
[Dad]

17:14.349 --> 17:15.109
Fei.

17:15.849 --> 17:16.740
Hello, Dad.

17:18.339 --> 17:21.060
Well...
I received the photos and the letter.

17:23.210 --> 17:23.940
Fei,

17:24.550 --> 17:25.410
are you crying?

17:28.300 --> 17:30.420
No, I'm not.

17:31.340 --> 17:32.940
I'm really not.

17:37.360 --> 17:38.320
I know.

17:39.130 --> 17:41.450
It's not easy in a big city.

17:42.790 --> 17:45.120
Come home and take a break
if you're tired.

17:45.740 --> 17:47.680
You're getting married soon anyway.

17:47.680 --> 17:49.060
Auntie He and I

17:49.460 --> 17:51.490
hope you guys can stay for a few days.

17:52.000 --> 17:55.810
And we can have a word with Ruohai.

17:56.280 --> 17:57.840
No need, Dad.

17:59.490 --> 18:01.010
We broke up.

18:01.090 --> 18:02.090
You broke up?

18:02.440 --> 18:04.680
You... you broke up?

18:05.130 --> 18:06.690
What happened, Fei?

18:07.690 --> 18:08.620
Did he bully you?

18:10.700 --> 18:13.530
No, he didn't.

18:14.110 --> 18:15.900
I wasn't wronged.

18:16.670 --> 18:17.760
It's just that

18:18.900 --> 18:21.660
our plans for the future

18:22.220 --> 18:23.240
are different.

18:23.860 --> 18:25.250
We couldn't go on.

18:27.380 --> 18:28.710
How is that possible?

18:29.600 --> 18:31.800
You've been together for so many years.

18:32.400 --> 18:34.000
Why did you only realize that

18:34.010 --> 18:35.800
right before getting married?

18:36.890 --> 18:37.420
Fei.

18:38.470 --> 18:40.270
You're not telling me the truth.

18:41.240 --> 18:43.130
It is the truth, Dad.

18:45.130 --> 18:45.960
Fei,

18:46.600 --> 18:47.990
whatever you decide,

18:49.110 --> 18:50.350
I support you.

18:53.070 --> 18:53.590
I know.

18:55.760 --> 18:57.600
Okay, Dad. I'm hanging up.

18:58.780 --> 18:59.780
Go to sleep early.

19:45.690 --> 19:52.320
♪ What matters to me is what you need ♪

19:53.580 --> 19:59.360
♪ Nothing more, nothing less,
I just hope it's something I can give ♪

20:00.300 --> 20:07.030
♪ What I cherish is what I have ♪

20:08.590 --> 20:13.200
♪ Every little moment,
I hope you're there with me ♪

20:15.450 --> 20:19.140
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

20:20.110 --> 20:23.140
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

20:23.420 --> 20:27.600
♪ Truths, lies,
and words said just for show ♪

20:28.690 --> 20:30.370
♪ Feel like I'm walking on cotton ♪

20:30.480 --> 20:34.830
♪ Harsh words, lies,
and words I can't make sense of ♪

20:35.920 --> 20:37.510
♪ Pretentious words wrapped
in glitter and glamour ♪

20:37.990 --> 20:42.310
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

20:42.800 --> 20:46.420
♪ Under your fiery eyes ♪

20:55.010 --> 21:02.100
♪ What I dream of is being with you ♪

21:02.890 --> 21:08.620
♪ Hand in hand,
taking life at an easy pace ♪

21:09.610 --> 21:15.540
♪ What I wish for
is something that lasts ♪

21:17.300 --> 21:23.270
♪ Day by day, holding you close
in a life that's simple and true ♪

21:24.140 --> 21:28.000
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

21:28.800 --> 21:32.070
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

21:32.430 --> 21:36.740
♪ Truths, lies,
and words said just for show ♪

21:37.690 --> 21:39.260
♪ Feel like I'm walking on cotton ♪

21:39.700 --> 21:43.880
♪ Harsh words, lies,
and words I can't make sense of ♪

21:44.920 --> 21:46.510
♪ Pretentious words wrapped
in glitter and glamour ♪

21:46.990 --> 21:51.310
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

21:51.800 --> 21:55.810
♪ Under your fiery eyes ♪

22:01.610 --> 22:06.450
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

22:08.560 --> 22:10.460
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

22:10.840 --> 22:15.840
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

23:01.550 --> 23:03.480
I thought you couldn't boil water.

23:05.200 --> 23:06.590
Not that I can't,

23:07.490 --> 23:08.810
but there's no need.

23:11.080 --> 23:12.120
When necessary,

23:12.150 --> 23:13.750
I'm a jack of all trades.

23:13.880 --> 23:15.540
I can do the work of two people.

23:15.760 --> 23:16.770
Come on.

23:16.790 --> 23:18.560
You just made hot cocoa.

23:18.740 --> 23:21.340
It's not like you've won
an Olympic gold medal.

23:23.260 --> 23:24.960
It's not because of the cocoa.

23:25.330 --> 23:28.870
It's a help in time of need.

23:31.090 --> 23:31.720
Remember,

23:32.770 --> 23:34.640
you owe me this time.

23:34.840 --> 23:35.370
I owe...

23:36.460 --> 23:38.680
Why? I bought the cocoa powder.

23:38.700 --> 23:40.300
You just mixed it with water.

23:40.770 --> 23:41.430
We're even.

23:42.700 --> 23:44.700
You're so good at calculating, huh?

23:47.220 --> 23:49.080
I used to be an investment banker,

23:49.300 --> 23:51.700
al-although I'm unemployed now.

23:53.470 --> 23:55.340
As long as you know your field.

23:56.610 --> 23:59.910
Life is self-investment.

24:00.250 --> 24:01.810
Time and energy

24:02.080 --> 24:03.990
are our capital.

24:04.370 --> 24:05.770
-We…
-Alright, alright.

24:06.080 --> 24:07.190
I don't want a lecture today.

24:07.190 --> 24:08.650
I have to work on my report.

24:08.910 --> 24:11.520
You don't even have a job now.
What report?

24:11.540 --> 24:12.570
Stop pretending.

24:13.660 --> 24:14.270
Thanks.

24:27.870 --> 24:32.450
Making cocoa is self-investment.

24:33.330 --> 24:34.520
Li Yifei was right.

24:34.920 --> 24:37.540
Life is a full self-investment.

24:38.380 --> 24:39.880
I used to think

24:39.900 --> 24:42.070
investing in a stable home

24:42.100 --> 24:44.640
could bring peace of mind
and compound interest.

24:44.640 --> 24:47.070
But investment and risk are twins.

24:45.450 --> 24:49.550
[Statement]

24:47.410 --> 24:48.930
Even banks go bankrupt,

24:49.050 --> 24:50.510
so what is really safe?

24:50.650 --> 24:52.880
Investing the future in love

24:52.900 --> 24:54.480
is living on the edge.

25:06.010 --> 25:08.110
[Information Technology Department]

25:13.730 --> 25:14.560
[Information Technology Department]

25:17.670 --> 25:18.990
[Information Technology Department]

25:22.000 --> 25:23.780
[Information Technology Department]

25:22.470 --> 25:23.730
This is your result?

25:23.870 --> 25:24.930
In the morning meeting,

25:24.930 --> 25:26.670
our department
was criticized for being inefficient

25:26.670 --> 25:27.520
and error-prone recently.

25:27.520 --> 25:29.230
It directly affected
the marketing department's work.

25:29.230 --> 25:32.090
How can
templated business analysis data be wrong?

25:32.530 --> 25:33.420
Even reports and management files

25:33.420 --> 25:35.080
could get lost.

25:33.460 --> 25:36.790
[Information Technology Department]

25:35.470 --> 25:36.950
For the simplest system maintenance tasks,

25:36.950 --> 25:38.600
we can't even find the right person!

25:38.600 --> 25:40.130
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

25:39.380 --> 25:40.110
Come on.

25:40.220 --> 25:42.460
Can you guys please pull yourselves
together and let me worry a little less?

25:42.460 --> 25:43.270
He Li,

25:43.430 --> 25:44.940
we've been working very hard.

25:44.940 --> 25:46.590
Everyone has been working overtime lately.

25:46.590 --> 25:47.750
What's the use of that?

25:47.750 --> 25:49.750
The data is all wrong!

25:50.310 --> 25:51.420
Pull yourselves together, everyone.

25:51.420 --> 25:52.740
Self-check first,

25:51.460 --> 25:57.290
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

25:52.920 --> 25:54.050
and give me a report.

25:55.310 --> 25:57.180
Redo all of those.

26:01.600 --> 26:03.520
[Information Technology Department]

26:08.100 --> 26:09.360
Look how angry He Li is.

26:09.380 --> 26:11.750
Qian Fei was the one
handling those files before.

26:11.750 --> 26:12.810
Now that she's not here,

26:12.810 --> 26:14.540
the whole back office is a mess.

26:15.460 --> 26:16.750
Now that you mention it,

26:16.750 --> 26:18.320
I miss her a bit.

26:18.480 --> 26:20.630
Yeah, she was very capable.

26:20.650 --> 26:22.300
Why was she the one fired?

27:01.570 --> 27:03.530
So noisy! Can't people sleep?

27:03.760 --> 27:05.090
Get up quickly.

27:05.110 --> 27:06.980
Regular schedule is good for health.

27:06.980 --> 27:07.980
Regular my ass.

27:08.410 --> 27:10.740
You don't sleep at night, and you won't
let others sleep during the day.

27:10.740 --> 27:12.090
Are you on steroids?

27:19.600 --> 27:22.400
What a shabby door.
It has no soundproofing at all.

27:26.340 --> 27:28.670
Landlady, it's so early in the morning...

27:32.510 --> 27:35.340
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

27:36.260 --> 27:39.660
♪ You always bump into my little secrets ♪

27:40.600 --> 27:42.190
♪ In my eyebrows and eyelashes ♪

27:42.900 --> 27:44.180
♪ In the curve of my lips, in my hair ♪

27:44.670 --> 27:46.720
♪ Like the raindrops in spring I like ♪

27:47.350 --> 27:48.990
♪ Or the kitten in the afternoon ♪

27:49.620 --> 27:53.320
♪ Why is it always you,
that smile on your lips ♪

27:54.010 --> 27:57.820
♪ I blurt out I like you,
and I only like you ♪

27:58.520 --> 27:59.250
I'm leaving.

28:00.420 --> 28:01.130
Bye-bye.

28:06.310 --> 28:07.070
This girl.

28:08.620 --> 28:10.690
That was quite something.

28:11.730 --> 28:13.490
She's a bit different today.

28:20.080 --> 28:21.080
Jingjing.

28:21.420 --> 28:23.180
You look good today.

28:23.210 --> 28:24.560
It seems you have...

28:26.250 --> 28:27.050
Wait a moment.

28:27.320 --> 28:27.910
Hello.

28:28.710 --> 28:30.970
Yes, that display board must be changed.

28:30.970 --> 28:31.970
The time is tight?

28:32.040 --> 28:33.470
Then work overtime and redo it.

28:33.470 --> 28:34.380
It definitely won't work as it is now.

28:34.380 --> 28:35.790
The words are printed backwards.

28:35.790 --> 28:36.590
I don't care.

28:36.610 --> 28:37.780
He can ruin his own reputation,

28:37.780 --> 28:38.890
but not mine.

28:40.130 --> 28:41.580
Deal with this first.

28:41.750 --> 28:42.850
And I'm having lunch now.

28:42.850 --> 28:44.910
I won't answer calls for half an hour.

28:45.300 --> 28:46.060
Bye-bye.

28:46.950 --> 28:49.210
You're so busy. Maybe you should go back.

28:49.540 --> 28:50.740
It's fine.

28:50.770 --> 28:52.460
I need to take a break too.

28:53.110 --> 28:54.250
If I knew you were this busy,

28:54.250 --> 28:55.900
I wouldn't have asked you out today.

28:55.900 --> 28:56.980
This is nothing.

28:57.000 --> 28:59.040
I got 5 hours of sleep last night.

28:59.070 --> 29:00.530
If I get really busy,

29:00.710 --> 29:03.260
I probably won't even see my pillow.

29:04.770 --> 29:06.480
You said on the phone you had a report

29:06.480 --> 29:07.810
you wanted me to look at?

29:08.190 --> 29:10.250
Let's skip it today. Maybe next time.

29:10.790 --> 29:12.200
I have this much time.

29:12.220 --> 29:13.910
Hurry up and give it to me.

29:22.510 --> 29:24.040
A report about Shanlifang?

29:25.010 --> 29:26.340
I want to return to He Jing.

29:26.340 --> 29:27.480
Can you check this report

29:27.480 --> 29:29.300
and see if it can impress Director Fang?

29:29.300 --> 29:32.400
Returning to He Jing,
joining Fang Yun's team,

29:32.600 --> 29:34.650
and participating in Shanlifang's IPO?

29:34.650 --> 29:35.600
Is it feasible?

29:36.020 --> 29:38.150
Yes, of course it is.

29:38.170 --> 29:39.270
With your abilities,

29:39.270 --> 29:40.730
there's no problem at all.

29:55.620 --> 29:56.430
How is it?

29:56.990 --> 29:58.550
I think it's very good.

29:58.940 --> 30:01.460
Then give me some advice.

30:01.490 --> 30:04.350
I think you should find a professional
to look at it.

30:05.280 --> 30:06.630
Professional?

30:08.440 --> 30:11.160
I only know my former colleagues.

30:11.180 --> 30:13.330
It's not appropriate
to ask them for help now.

30:13.330 --> 30:14.850
Why look for former colleagues?

30:14.850 --> 30:17.200
Aren't you looking far
when something is close at hand?

30:17.200 --> 30:18.910
What's closer than this?

30:19.410 --> 30:20.750
Your home.

30:20.770 --> 30:21.730
Your tenant,

30:21.760 --> 30:22.950
isn't he also in investment banking?

30:22.950 --> 30:24.080
You mean Li Yifei?

30:25.230 --> 30:27.230
He slacks off every day.

30:27.250 --> 30:28.770
What good advice can he give?

30:28.770 --> 30:30.050
Slacks off?

30:30.070 --> 30:32.260
Didn't Dang Yu say
he was a project leader?

30:32.260 --> 30:34.120
That's the same level as Fang Yun.

30:34.140 --> 30:36.180
He was just pushed out to make up numbers.

30:36.180 --> 30:37.050
At least

30:37.250 --> 30:39.780
he's better than you,
a back-office analyst.

30:41.140 --> 30:41.930
True.

30:43.000 --> 30:44.790
Makes sense.

30:46.140 --> 30:48.560
But look at how cocky he is every day.

30:48.580 --> 30:50.150
If I ask him for advice,

30:50.230 --> 30:51.550
he'll be so arrogant.

30:52.770 --> 30:54.780
You still care about this?

30:54.800 --> 30:57.450
A real hero can bend and endure.

31:02.250 --> 31:03.710
Careful, careful.

31:04.160 --> 31:05.570
Don't scratch the floor.

31:05.660 --> 31:06.860
Lift it up. Lift it up.

31:06.930 --> 31:07.910
Good.

31:08.730 --> 31:11.460
Watch out for the door frame above.

31:11.900 --> 31:12.990
Li Yifei, what are you doing?

31:12.990 --> 31:13.800
You're back?

31:14.070 --> 31:15.330
I'm changing the door.

31:15.600 --> 31:17.250
Don't worry. I'm paying.

31:17.280 --> 31:18.610
You don't need to worry.

31:18.730 --> 31:19.930
I don't need to worry?

31:20.130 --> 31:21.200
This is my door.

31:21.220 --> 31:22.750
Did I allow you to change it?

31:22.980 --> 31:24.810
Isn't it in the contract?

31:25.370 --> 31:28.110
I have the right, for living convenience,

31:28.350 --> 31:29.520
to modify my room.

31:29.550 --> 31:31.080
This door is part of my room.

31:31.730 --> 31:33.460
You have no right to interfere.

31:35.330 --> 31:37.250
In the contract?

31:37.810 --> 31:39.940
Look yourself if you don't believe me.

31:42.270 --> 31:43.400
Then how did the old door

31:43.400 --> 31:45.080
inconvenience you?

31:45.290 --> 31:47.290
That old door had no soundproofing.

31:52.040 --> 31:54.730
Did... did you buy a dishwasher?

31:55.820 --> 31:57.090
Let me tell you, Li Yifei.

31:57.090 --> 31:58.610
This cabinet is new.

31:58.630 --> 31:59.370
If you dare...

31:59.370 --> 32:00.820
Calm down.

32:00.850 --> 32:02.380
I returned the dishwasher.

32:02.860 --> 32:04.460
You're the only one
using the kitchen anyway.

32:04.460 --> 32:07.060
It would be a loss for me
to pay for renovations.

32:07.900 --> 32:09.640
Then why change the door?

32:09.690 --> 32:12.460
Don't you understand?
It wasn't soundproof.

32:12.520 --> 32:14.690
The sound of you washing up
in the morning,

32:14.690 --> 32:16.130
you walking around,

32:16.150 --> 32:17.320
you on the phone,

32:17.340 --> 32:18.540
the washing machine,

32:18.540 --> 32:19.260
the fridge,

32:19.280 --> 32:20.480
and even your teeth grinding at night—

32:20.480 --> 32:21.740
I can hear it all, okay?

32:21.740 --> 32:22.800
It affects my sleep.

32:22.800 --> 32:24.010
I don't grind my teeth.

32:24.010 --> 32:25.890
Okay, what if I grind my teeth?

32:25.910 --> 32:26.720
Right?

32:27.110 --> 32:28.440
Anyway, with this door,

32:28.450 --> 32:29.780
it's good for both of us.

32:30.320 --> 32:31.530
The whole world will be quiet.

32:31.530 --> 32:33.130
We won't disturb each other.

32:33.540 --> 32:35.290
Besides, doesn't this door match

32:35.290 --> 32:36.460
your house's style?

32:36.480 --> 32:37.030
Isn't it great?

32:37.030 --> 32:38.270
You should be thanking me.

32:38.270 --> 32:40.400
It's fine. No need to thank me too much.

32:40.620 --> 32:41.990
Who wants to thank you?

32:45.160 --> 32:46.000
Sir,

32:46.020 --> 32:47.770
please be careful when installing.

32:47.770 --> 32:49.370
I've already told him.

32:50.190 --> 32:51.470
No need for you to.

32:55.250 --> 32:56.380
Yes, be careful.

32:56.600 --> 32:58.360
Don't damage anything while installing it.

32:58.360 --> 33:00.490
This landlady bites, I'm telling you.

33:03.940 --> 33:06.000
Li Yifei's stupid mouth.

33:06.380 --> 33:08.180
He angers people when he speaks.

33:08.490 --> 33:10.550
How can I ask him for help?

33:16.630 --> 33:18.220
The event ended early,

33:18.240 --> 33:20.110
but we can't slack off.

33:20.280 --> 33:22.720
The materials list must be sorted

33:22.740 --> 33:24.070
and sent to me ASAP.

33:24.800 --> 33:25.330
Bye-bye.

33:27.520 --> 33:28.560
Lu Ze.

34:06.900 --> 34:08.580
Lu Ze, I didn't expect

34:08.610 --> 34:10.790
you and Wang Ruohai
to be the same kind of people.

34:10.790 --> 34:12.840
You're even sneakier than him.

34:47.500 --> 34:49.610
You look quite different today.

34:49.719 --> 34:51.250
More energetic, right?

34:51.550 --> 34:53.530
Not the sluggish state from before.

34:53.530 --> 34:54.270
Right?

34:54.300 --> 34:54.969
Honey.

34:55.310 --> 34:57.230
I reflected seriously.

34:57.530 --> 35:00.170
I've been neglecting you too much.

35:00.570 --> 35:01.530
So I've decided

35:01.560 --> 35:02.900
to make it up to you

35:02.920 --> 35:04.780
while I'm not too busy these days.

35:05.190 --> 35:06.780
How will you make it up to me?

35:07.250 --> 35:10.070
We haven't done that in a long time.

35:12.790 --> 35:14.120
So this is what you like?

35:14.260 --> 35:16.050
Whatever you like, darling.

35:16.070 --> 35:17.460
Whatever I like?

35:18.180 --> 35:19.860
Alright!

35:21.380 --> 35:22.270
Darling, it hurts!

35:22.270 --> 35:22.880
It hurts!

35:22.900 --> 35:23.810
It hurts, darling!

35:23.810 --> 35:24.920
It hurts!

35:29.820 --> 35:30.600
Come on.

35:31.330 --> 35:32.110
Well, darling...

35:32.110 --> 35:33.550
Don't call me darling!

35:35.190 --> 35:38.320
Wait. Why are you angry?

35:38.340 --> 35:40.070
You're asking me why I'm angry?

35:41.060 --> 35:42.500
Don't you know why?

35:44.220 --> 35:45.200
What did you do today?

35:45.200 --> 35:46.290
Who did you see?

35:46.790 --> 35:49.020
If you lie to me,

35:49.040 --> 35:50.250
we break up right now.

35:51.980 --> 35:52.510
Alright.

35:52.970 --> 35:54.330
Let me ask you.

35:55.080 --> 35:56.740
Why did you come back so early?

35:56.970 --> 35:58.380
My work was done.

35:58.740 --> 36:00.870
Taking a shower right after coming in?

36:01.080 --> 36:04.120
I missed you too much.
I couldn't hold it any longer.

36:04.680 --> 36:06.280
And you even washed clothes?

36:07.170 --> 36:09.140
I wanted to help you with chores.

36:09.610 --> 36:10.140
Alright.

36:11.600 --> 36:13.400
What about the mud on your shoes?

36:13.750 --> 36:16.080
There isn't even a park near your company.

36:16.150 --> 36:18.380
How did your shoes get so muddy?

36:18.480 --> 36:20.690
There's mud on the roads
around the neighborhood.

36:20.690 --> 36:21.990
It's normal.

36:22.020 --> 36:24.620
I'm telling you,
you're acting very weird now.

36:25.880 --> 36:26.600
And this.

36:27.770 --> 36:29.100
Who did you buy this for?

36:36.560 --> 36:37.230
Alright.

36:37.980 --> 36:39.300
I'll explain.

36:41.990 --> 36:43.200
Here's the thing.

36:43.970 --> 36:45.230
After the forum,

36:46.000 --> 36:47.870
our company isn't as busy.

36:48.290 --> 36:48.970
So...

36:49.760 --> 36:51.960
I wanted to put our matter on the agenda.

36:52.220 --> 36:53.000
So...

36:53.780 --> 36:55.080
you bought this ring?

36:55.600 --> 36:56.310
Yes.

36:56.830 --> 36:59.570
I also prepared a special proposal.

36:59.590 --> 37:02.040
So I went out early to rehearse.

37:02.070 --> 37:04.650
Otherwise,
why would I have mud on my shoes?

37:05.920 --> 37:06.850
Really?

37:07.000 --> 37:07.850
Really.

37:08.270 --> 37:08.880
Why...

37:09.330 --> 37:10.890
Why would I lie about this?

37:15.790 --> 37:16.520
Look.

37:17.200 --> 37:19.180
I have a video.

37:21.310 --> 37:22.440
Early this morning.

37:29.290 --> 37:30.560
Marry...

37:33.020 --> 37:33.660
Mom.

37:33.830 --> 37:34.790
Marry Mom.

37:35.330 --> 37:36.680
No, no.

37:37.480 --> 37:38.500
It was just a rehearsal.

37:38.500 --> 37:40.210
There were bound to be flaws.

37:41.860 --> 37:43.460
So annoying. You found out.

37:43.480 --> 37:45.210
I can't give you a surprise now.

37:46.500 --> 37:48.360
Alright, alright. I'm sorry.

37:48.750 --> 37:50.170
I blamed you unfairly.

37:50.720 --> 37:52.350
Since you already found out,

37:57.150 --> 37:58.310
I'll propose now.

38:00.200 --> 38:01.790
Be serious. Stand up.

38:02.270 --> 38:03.060
Be serious.

38:04.110 --> 38:04.590
Well...

38:05.560 --> 38:07.900
Are you being serious?

38:08.960 --> 38:10.870
I-I'm very serious.

38:19.600 --> 38:20.400
Yao Jingjing.

38:21.480 --> 38:24.380
Although the ceremony isn't ready,

38:25.120 --> 38:26.640
my heart is.

38:31.040 --> 38:32.040
Will you marry me?

38:47.270 --> 38:48.960
♪ I really miss you ♪

38:49.330 --> 38:50.930
♪ My heart is pounding fast ♪

38:51.500 --> 38:54.220
♪ Syncing my breath
to a frequency that longs for you ♪

38:54.840 --> 38:56.070
♪ I love you so much ♪

38:55.010 --> 38:56.340
I will.

38:56.950 --> 38:59.210
♪ The only you in the whole world ♪

39:00.420 --> 39:03.640
♪ Living in my heart ♪

39:12.400 --> 39:14.340
♪ I really miss you ♪

39:15.180 --> 39:16.400
♪ My heart is pounding fast ♪

39:16.970 --> 39:19.570
♪ Syncing my breath
to a frequency that longs for you ♪

39:19.230 --> 39:21.250
So it's this finger?

39:20.180 --> 39:21.270
♪ I love you so much ♪

39:21.740 --> 39:22.300
My wife.

39:22.370 --> 39:24.840
♪ The only you in the whole world ♪

39:22.570 --> 39:23.280
I love you!

39:24.330 --> 39:27.090
I love you too!

39:27.660 --> 39:32.410
♪ Living in my heart ♪

39:32.390 --> 39:33.090
Let's go.

39:33.380 --> 39:35.860
Time to get down to business!

39:55.870 --> 39:56.930
What are you doing?

39:58.090 --> 40:00.260
Um, I just want to know...

40:00.390 --> 40:01.460
if you had dinner.

40:05.560 --> 40:07.310
If you don't mind,

40:07.330 --> 40:08.790
how about we eat together?

40:12.150 --> 40:13.810
You want to treat me to dinner?

40:13.960 --> 40:14.930
Let's go.

40:15.570 --> 40:16.300
Really?

40:16.330 --> 40:17.330
Really. Let's go.

40:17.480 --> 40:18.280
Wait a minute.

40:19.410 --> 40:21.210
Suddenly treating me to dinner?

40:22.750 --> 40:24.640
He who is overly attentive

40:25.130 --> 40:26.660
has a hidden agenda.

40:30.190 --> 40:32.240
If you really don't want to eat,

40:32.260 --> 40:33.380
I won't force you.

40:33.450 --> 40:34.160
Why?

40:34.330 --> 40:35.390
Why wouldn't I eat?

40:36.510 --> 40:37.610
It's a free meal.

40:37.640 --> 40:38.360
I'll go!

40:41.830 --> 40:43.560
But I must make it clear in advance.

40:43.560 --> 40:46.420
I'm a bit of a germaphobe.

40:46.680 --> 40:48.080
I don't like having people pick food

40:48.080 --> 40:50.480
from the same plate with their chopsticks.

40:51.760 --> 40:53.700
I get it. Individual portions.
That's not a bad thing.

40:53.700 --> 40:54.470
Sensible.

40:54.730 --> 40:55.730
You're sensible.

40:55.790 --> 40:56.440
Here.

41:00.410 --> 41:02.890
I remember you like this dish
with eggplant.

41:03.070 --> 41:04.310
Take more.

41:06.260 --> 41:07.120
So I'll take it?

41:10.410 --> 41:11.410
I won't be polite.

41:11.420 --> 41:13.150
Please don't. Don't be polite.

41:23.040 --> 41:24.350
Not bad. It tastes good.

41:24.350 --> 41:25.110
Right?

41:25.130 --> 41:26.470
Landlady, I have to say,

41:26.980 --> 41:28.290
with your cooking skills,

41:28.290 --> 41:28.960
you have a bright future.

41:28.960 --> 41:30.490
You could be a chef, really.

41:38.390 --> 41:40.160
Why aren't you eating? Eat up.

41:43.020 --> 41:45.420
Don't look at me and smile.
It creeps me out.

41:45.440 --> 41:48.060
Don't overthink it. You're my tenant.

41:48.080 --> 41:49.710
We must

41:49.730 --> 41:51.030
maintain a good relationship.

41:51.030 --> 41:52.730
It's only right
I make some food and drinks for us.

41:52.730 --> 41:53.860
Don't overthink it.

41:54.690 --> 41:55.420
That's true.

41:55.580 --> 41:57.260
Eat before it gets cold.

41:59.560 --> 42:00.230
Delicious.

42:02.520 --> 42:04.050
But let me be clear upfront.

42:05.070 --> 42:06.320
I won't wash dishes.

42:06.830 --> 42:08.080
A gentleman only eats, doesn't wash.

42:08.080 --> 42:09.730
I'm only responsible for eating.

42:09.730 --> 42:11.500
How could I let you wash dishes?

42:11.540 --> 42:13.380
This meal is entirely my treat.

42:13.820 --> 42:15.020
Just enjoy your meal.

42:15.750 --> 42:16.560
Okay.

42:20.330 --> 42:22.390
If you only eat and don't wash dishes,

42:22.990 --> 42:25.770
does that mean... you owe me a favor?

42:26.770 --> 42:27.420
See?

42:28.320 --> 42:30.360
I knew you had ulterior motives.

42:34.310 --> 42:34.830
Tell me.

42:34.860 --> 42:36.340
Tell me, what are you up to?

42:37.530 --> 42:39.420
Well... as you know...

42:39.450 --> 42:41.180
I'm a straightforward person.

42:44.390 --> 42:45.710
I'm doing this

42:46.480 --> 42:48.140
because you left me no choice.

42:50.100 --> 42:51.030
What do you mean?

42:51.770 --> 42:52.890
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:53.760 --> 42:55.790
You're actually
quite interesting sometimes.

42:55.790 --> 42:57.480
When other girls broke up,

42:57.500 --> 42:59.220
they cried and made a scene.

42:59.480 --> 43:01.540
But you acted like nothing happened.

43:01.750 --> 43:02.800
That person

43:02.870 --> 43:05.670
was the biggest flaw in my life plan.

43:05.960 --> 43:07.190
After the patch,

43:07.690 --> 43:09.230
he doesn't need to exist anymore.

43:09.230 --> 43:10.290
Director Fang,

43:10.670 --> 43:12.900
this is my research on Shanlifang.

43:13.000 --> 43:15.200
I want to know where its weaknesses are.

43:15.310 --> 43:16.520
A person who doesn't cherish things

43:16.520 --> 43:18.160
is worthless.

43:18.400 --> 43:18.960
Understand?
